              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hebele ŵakwete ŵanace ŵatatu, mena gawo galiji Yafileti, Shomeli ni Hotamu; soni ŵakwete mwanace jwamkongwe jumo lina lyakwe Shuwa.",
          "type": "text",
